{"seq":1,"slug":"overseas-return-center-warehouse","title":"海外退货中心仓与集货","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/return-consolidate-overseas/overseas-return-center-warehouse","wordCount":2253,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"海外退货中心仓与集货\">海外退货中心仓与集货</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>退货包裹的物理旅程有一个反直觉的特点：它在被买家寄出的那一刻，通常是<strong>没有目的地</strong>的。平台生成的 RMA 面单只指向一个区域性的收件节点，而不是卖家的仓库——因为让每件退货单独漂洋过海，运费会立刻超过商品的残值。这个区域性收件节点就是海外退货中心仓（Overseas Return Center），它是整条跨境逆向链路里唯一一个「先收货、后决策」的位置。</p>\n<p>理解它的存在理由，可以用一个简单的不等式。设单件退货运回原产国的到岸逆向成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，商品在该市场的可再售价值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>。如果对退货池中的每一件都检验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r &lt; V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 并只回运满足者，那么结论几乎总是「只有一小部分值得回运」。但如果把散件先集中到一个节点，跨境的运费就可以从按件计价变成按体积/重量计价的批量计价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 会随集拼批量下降一个数量级。海外退货中心仓的全部工程价值，就在于把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从「单件费率」推向「批量费率」——它本身不产生价值，它生产的是<strong>让 1.2 的处置决策有意义的成本前提</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中心仓的三种运营形态\">中心仓的三种运营形态</h2><p>集货节点由谁运营，决定了它的能力边界与数据接口形态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运营形态</th>\n<th>谁运营</th>\n<th>能做什么</th>\n<th>数据接口特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台自营退货仓</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>收货、初检、判定就地处置、批量回运</td>\n<td>与平台订单/售后系统同源，数据实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方退货服务商</td>\n<td>3PL/逆向服务商</td>\n<td>收货、初检、就地再售、批量回运</td>\n<td>通过 API/EDI 对接，事件粒度粗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家自建海外仓</td>\n<td>卖家或卖家代理</td>\n<td>收货、深度翻新、就地再售</td>\n<td>卖家自有 WMS，需要自建对接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三种形态的共同点是<strong>都必须完成同一组最小动作</strong>：收货登记、身份绑定（这件货属于哪张 RMA）、外观初检、以及一个「是否进入回运候选池」的初步标记。差别只在深度：第三方服务商通常止步于初检与就地转售，卖家自建仓则可能直接承担 3.1 描述的完整质检分级。系统设计上的含义是，退货中心仓抽象成一个<strong>可插拔的收货端点</strong>，把「初检结论」作为统一的事件契约向上游抛出，而不是假设所有节点都有相同的作业能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"收货时系统必须捕获的事实\">收货时系统必须捕获的事实</h3><p>初检阶段能捕获的事实决定了后面所有决策的质量。最关键的是<strong>身份三重绑定</strong>：RMA 单号（业务身份）、原订单行（商品与价格身份）、以及实物上的唯一标识（GTIN 与序列号或批次号）。GS1 标准把这三类标识定义为可组合的应用标识符：AI (00) 标识物流单元（SSCC）、AI (01) 标识商品（GTIN）、AI (21) 标识单品序列号、AI (10) 标识批次（见 <a href=\"https://ref.gs1.org/ai/\">GS1 Application Identifiers</a>）。把序列号当作退货收货的一等字段是必要的，因为<strong>没有序列号就无法证明退货的实物就是原订单发出的那一件</strong>——这是后续防欺诈与关税原状证明的共同前提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"最小事实集\">最小事实集</h3><p>到仓收货的事件契约只需要一组最小事实，但这组事实缺任何一项都会在后续某处变成阻塞。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事实</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>缺失后的阻塞点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承运商运单号</td>\n<td>交付确认与异常索赔</td>\n<td>无法证明已收货，赔付无据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RMA 单号</td>\n<td>绑定业务身份</td>\n<td>无法触发退款联动（见 4.3）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原订单行 ID</td>\n<td>确定原价、SKU、市场</td>\n<td>残值无法计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GTIN / 序列号</td>\n<td>实物身份</td>\n<td>无法证明「是同一件」，关税减免不成立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到仓时间戳</td>\n<td>时效起算</td>\n<td>拼批窗口无法判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外观初检照片与结论</td>\n<td>状态证据</td>\n<td>分级无输入，纠纷无证据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"到仓收货的状态机\">到仓收货的状态机</h3><p>收货不是一个瞬时动作，而是一串可失败的步骤。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[承运商交付] --&gt; B[到仓登记&lt;br/&gt;扫描运单]&#10;  B --&gt; C{身份可解析?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| C1[进入待认领区&lt;br/&gt;人工介入]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[绑定 RMA 与订单行]&#10;  D --&gt; E[外观初检&lt;br/&gt;拍照留证]&#10;  E --&gt; F{是否进入&lt;br/&gt;回运候选?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[回运候选池&lt;br/&gt;等待 1.3 集拼]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[就地处置队列&lt;br/&gt;等待 3.1 分级]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D\">graph TD\n  A[承运商交付] --&gt; B[到仓登记&lt;br/&gt;扫描运单]\n  B --&gt; C{身份可解析?}\n  C --&gt;|否| C1[进入待认领区&lt;br/&gt;人工介入]\n  C --&gt;|是| D[绑定 RMA 与订单行]\n  D --&gt; E[外观初检&lt;br/&gt;拍照留证]\n  E --&gt; F{是否进入&lt;br/&gt;回运候选?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[回运候选池&lt;br/&gt;等待 1.3 集拼]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[就地处置队列&lt;br/&gt;等待 3.1 分级]\n  C1 --&gt; D</pre><p>这个状态机的工程要点在于 <code>C1</code> 这个分支：<strong>无法解析身份的退货必须进入一个显式的人工队列</strong>，而不是被丢弃或静默归类。因为一旦身份丢失，这件货既无法回运（拿不到关税减免，2.1 会说明原因），也无法合规销毁（没有归属的废弃物处理是违规的），它会变成一个纯粹的成本黑洞。把这个队列做成一个可监控的指标（「未认领率」）是集货节点最基础的运营质量指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集货批量与成本曲线\">集货批量与成本曲线</h2><p>集货节点收到的退货池，其结构通常高度偏斜：少数几个 SKU 占了大部分件数，长尾 SKU 各只有一两件。这种分布的物理含义是<strong>混拼的必要性</strong>：不可能为每个 SKU 单独攒一个整柜，只能把不同 SKU、不同成色的货混装到同一个集装单元里，靠总体积与总重量去摊薄跨境段的固定成本。</p>\n<p>设某集拼批次的总体积为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，总重量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，跨境段的报价头程通常取二者中计费更高的一个（体积重与实重取大）。批次化的目标函数因此不是「装满」，而是<strong>让单位重量的跨境成本随批次规模下降</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{unit} = \\frac{F + p_w \\cdot W_b + p_v \\cdot \\max(V_b, W_b/k)}{N_b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是批次的固定操作成本（打托、熏蒸、单证、报关代理），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按重与按体积的变动费率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是体积重换算系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是批次内件数。这个式子解释了为什么 1.3 强调「拼箱窗口」——当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 太小时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F/N_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这一项会让单件成本高到否定回运决策。</p>\n<h3 id=\"集装单元的标识\">集装单元的标识</h3><p>集拼批次的物理载体是托盘或箱，每个载体需要一个唯一标识才能在跨境段的多次交接中保持可追溯。SSCC（Serial Shipping Container Code，GS1 的 AI 00）就是为此设计的物流单元标识——它是一个固定长度的数字串，包含扩展位（用于表示单元类型，如托盘/箱）、厂商识别码与校验位。用 SSCC 而不是自编号的好处是：它在跨境段被承运商、货代、报关行共同理解，减少一次人工转录就减少一次错配风险。批次与 SSCC 的对应关系必须落库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE return_receipt (&#10;  receipt_id        BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  return_center_id  BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  carrier_tracking  VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  rma_id            BIGINT,&#10;  order_line_id     BIGINT,&#10;  gtin              VARCHAR(14),&#10;  serial_no         VARCHAR(64),&#10;  received_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  initial_grade     CHAR(2),                       -- 初检预判等级&#10;  status            VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,          -- RECEIVED/UNIDENTIFIED/RETURN_CANDIDATE/LOCAL_DISPOSAL&#10;  UNIQUE (carrier_tracking, received_at)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE return_consolidation_batch (&#10;  batch_id          BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  origin_return_center_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  destination_node_id     BIGINT NOT NULL,       -- 回运目的节点（国内翻新中心/保税仓）&#10;  carrier_scac      CHAR(4)      NOT NULL,&#10;  status            VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,        -- BUILDING/SEALED/HANDED_OVER/IN_TRANSIT/CUSTOMS/DELIVERED&#10;  total_pieces      INT          NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  total_gross_kg    NUMERIC(10,3) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  total_volume_cbm  NUMERIC(10,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  sealed_at         TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  created_at        TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_positive CHECK (total_pieces &gt;= 0)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE return_consolidation_item (&#10;  batch_id          BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES return_consolidation_batch(batch_id),&#10;  rma_id            BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  sscc              VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,         -- 所在物流单元（AI 00）&#10;  serial_no         VARCHAR(64),                  -- 单品序列号（AI 21）&#10;  declared_grade    CHAR(2),                       -- 初检预判等级，见 3.1&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (batch_id, rma_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> return_receipt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  receipt_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  return_center_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_tracking  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rma_id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_line_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gtin              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  serial_no         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  received_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  initial_grade     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 初检预判等级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- RECEIVED/UNIDENTIFIED/RETURN_CANDIDATE/LOCAL_DISPOSAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (carrier_tracking, received_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark: